{"seq":1,"slug":"safety-signal-source-taxonomy","title":"安全信号来源分类、采集与归一化数据模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-product-recall-safety-response/safety-signal-risk-data-system/safety-signal-source-taxonomy","wordCount":3011,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"安全信号来源分类-采集与归一化数据模型\">安全信号来源分类、采集与归一化数据模型</h1><p>一家做锂电充电宝的深圳卖家同时在亚马逊北美、TikTok Shop 英区和欧盟自建站售卖同一型号。某个周二，它在四小时内先后收到四类「可能和产品安全有关」的东西：一条客服工单说买家充电时闻到焦味；一条一星评论贴了外壳鼓包照片；亚马逊后台一封「产品安全审查」邮件；以及欧盟 Safety Gate 每周警报里一条同品类充电器的召回。四条记录格式完全不同——客服 JSON、评论文本、平台邮件、监管机构的结构化通报——但它们对这家公司而言是<strong>同一件事的不同侧面的信号</strong>。这篇文档解决的就是：<strong>安全信号怎么分类、怎么采回来、怎么归一化成一张能支撑风险研判的表。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-安全信号的定义边界与采集流水线位置\">核心概念：安全信号的定义边界与采集流水线位置</h2><p>先划清一个容易混的边界：<strong>安全信号（safety signal）不等于事故（accident）</strong>。欧盟《通用产品安全条例》（Regulation (EU) 2023/988，GPSR）第 3 条把「事故」定义为「与产品有关、导致或几乎导致死亡、严重伤害或健康突发损害的事件」，把「严重风险」定义为「需要公共机构快速介入的风险，包括有害影响并不立即显现的情形」。信号的口径比这两者都宽：<strong>任何可能指向产品风险的观察</strong>——一条抱怨、一次退货原因码、一批抽检不合格、一条监管通报——都是信号。信号是<strong>待研判的原料</strong>，事故是<strong>已确认的事实</strong>，二者必须是不同的状态。落进工程，先回答四个分类维度：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[内部运营源&lt;br/&gt;客服/退货/评论/质检] --&gt; C[采集层&lt;br/&gt;pull / push / stream]&#10;    B[监管公开源&lt;br/&gt;Safety Gate / CPSC / openFDA] --&gt; C&#10;    D[渠道平台源&lt;br/&gt;平台安全工单/下架通知] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; E[原始落地区&lt;br/&gt;raw landing + 源快照]&#10;    E --&gt; F[归一化层&lt;br/&gt;统一 signal 实体 + 分类法对齐]&#10;    F --&gt; G[实体消解与去重&lt;br/&gt;信号簇]&#10;    G --&gt; H[风险研判&lt;br/&gt;下游消费者]\">flowchart TD\n    A[内部运营源&lt;br/&gt;客服/退货/评论/质检] --&gt; C[采集层&lt;br/&gt;pull / push / stream]\n    B[监管公开源&lt;br/&gt;Safety Gate / CPSC / openFDA] --&gt; C\n    D[渠道平台源&lt;br/&gt;平台安全工单/下架通知] --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; E[原始落地区&lt;br/&gt;raw landing + 源快照]\n    E --&gt; F[归一化层&lt;br/&gt;统一 signal 实体 + 分类法对齐]\n    F --&gt; G[实体消解与去重&lt;br/&gt;信号簇]\n    G --&gt; H[风险研判&lt;br/&gt;下游消费者]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分类维度</th>\n<th>取值示例</th>\n<th>对下游的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>来源主体</td>\n<td>用户 / 监管机构 / 平台 / 内部质检</td>\n<td>权威权重与法定时限触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构化程度</td>\n<td>JSON / 半结构化邮件 / 文本+图片</td>\n<td>解析成本与是否需人工确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时效通道</td>\n<td>拉取（日/周）/ 推送（小时）/ 流式</td>\n<td>信号延迟与召回响应速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权威性</td>\n<td>官方通报 / 平台判定 / 用户描述</td>\n<td>强度加权与误报容忍度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>权威性是跨境场景特有的痛点</strong>：同一条缺陷，在欧盟由 Safety Gate 以「严重风险」通报、在美国由 CPSC 以「recall」或「product safety warning」发布、在中国由市场监管总局缺陷产品管理中心公告，法律后果和时限完全不同，但底层可能是同一批货。归一化层若不保留来源权威维度与覆盖法域，下游就会把「用户抱怨」和「官方通报」当成同等强度的信号处理——而这两类信号触发的判定路径完全不同，见 <a href=\"../recall-regime-liability-model/mandatory-voluntary-recall-decision-mechanism\">强制召回与自愿召回的判定机制及平台-卖家-供应商责任分配</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信号源分类-运营内源-监管公开源与渠道平台源\">信号源分类：运营内源、监管公开源与渠道平台源</h2><p><strong>运营内源</strong>最早、最密集也最嘈杂：客服工单、退货/RMA 原因码、评论与 UGC 文本、仓储抽检、售后维修记录。价值在于<strong>先于监管发现趋势</strong>——监管通报通常滞后数月，而退货原因码的异常抬升可能提前数周出现。代价是极低的信噪比：一条「充电时发热」既可能是产品缺陷，也可能是用户误用，语义对齐要靠分类法做。</p>\n<p><strong>监管公开源</strong>权威最高，也是跨境场景下必须逐法域接的。欧盟侧核心是 Safety Gate——GPSR 第 24 条把它拆成三个组件：机构间快速警报系统（Rapid Alert System）、面向公众的 Safety Gate Portal、面向企业的 Safety Business Gateway；第 25–28 条规定警报与后续跟踪流程，委员会按周发布警报报告。美国侧是 CPSC 召回库，其检索面按记录类型（Recalls / Product Safety Warnings）、危险类型（hazard）、产品类别、制造国、救济方式（refund / repair / replace / dispose / new instructions）等受控词汇切分，天然适合结构化对齐。受管制品类还能接 openFDA 召回端点，它把原始记录标注成 JSON 并给出稳定可检索字段——<code>cfres_id</code>、<code>event_date_initiated</code>、<code>recall_status</code>、<code>recalling_firm</code>、<code>reason_for_recall</code>、<code>product_description</code> 等，覆盖自 2002 年起、按周更新。</p>\n<p><strong>渠道平台源</strong>是跨境特有的第三族：平台主动下发产品安全审查、下架通知、类目资质要求，多以邮件或站内信出现，结构化程度最低，却直接决定 listing 存活，必须尽快结构化成可跟踪对象。三族的采集与权威属性对照如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>源族</th>\n<th>时效</th>\n<th>结构化</th>\n<th>权威权重</th>\n<th>采集方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>运营内源</td>\n<td>小时–天</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低–中</td>\n<td>库表直读 / 事件流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监管公开源</td>\n<td>日–周（官方）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>API 拉取 / 周报解析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道平台源</td>\n<td>小时–天</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中–高</td>\n<td>邮箱解析 / webhook</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多源采集通道-拉取-推送-流式的取舍\">多源采集通道：拉取、推送、流式的取舍</h2><p>三族源接入机制不同，采集层不能只有一种通道。**拉取（pull）**适合监管公开源：openFDA 按周更新，CPSC 有召回接口，Safety Gate 有周报——都是低频、幂等、可重放的数据集。**推送（push）**适合监管机构直接通知经济运营者的场景，例如 GPSR 第 20 条要求制造商与进口商通过 Safety Business Gateway 上报事故，对应回执通道通常是邮件或回调。**流式（stream）**适合内源，客服与订单事件本身就跑在流上。</p>\n<p>工程上有三条不可退让的纪律。第一，<strong>原始落地区（raw landing zone）必须落在归一化之前</strong>，每条记录连同 <code>fetched_at</code>、HTTP 状态、源快照一起存原始形态——事后监管问询时，「当时那条通报原文是什么」是证据，归一化后的字段不是。第二，<strong>每条采集记录必须有确定性幂等键</strong> <code>source_id + source_record_id</code>，否则同一份周报重放一次就会灌进重复警报。第三，<strong>游标/水位要持久化</strong>，拉取型源用「上次成功水位」而不是「上次运行时间」做边界，避免页码漂移导致漏采。采集器接口不暴露「解析」，解析放到归一化层——两者解耦后，解析规则的迭代不需重跑采集，采集重试也不会污染已归一化的数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归一化数据模型-统一-signal-实体与分类法对齐\">归一化数据模型：统一 signal 实体与分类法对齐</h2><p>归一化的目标是把三族源的记录折叠成<strong>一张统一的 signal 表</strong>，字段语义跨源一致。核心不是「把所有字段塞进一个宽表」，而是<strong>明确哪些字段是语义锚点、哪些是来源特定的扩展</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>统一字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>来源映射示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>signal_id</code></td>\n<td>归一化后信号主键</td>\n<td>系统生成，非任何来源 ID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>source_ref</code></td>\n<td>溯源指针</td>\n<td><code>{source_id, source_record_id, raw_hash}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>signal_type</code></td>\n<td>信号类型枚举</td>\n<td>事故 / 缺陷报告 / 退货原因 / 监管通报 / 平台通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>product_ref</code></td>\n<td>产品标识</td>\n<td>优先 GTIN；缺失时按 SKU + 型号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>hazard_code</code></td>\n<td>危险分类法编码</td>\n<td>CPSC hazard 面 / 内部风险码，经 crosswalk 对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>jurisdiction</code></td>\n<td>相关法域</td>\n<td>监管源的申报国；内源推断自收货国</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>occurred_at</code> / <code>reported_at</code></td>\n<td>事件发生 / 对外可见时间</td>\n<td><code>event_date_initiated</code> / <code>event_date_posted</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>severity_claim</code></td>\n<td>来源<strong>声称</strong>的严重度</td>\n<td>未确认，与研判结论分离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>narrative</code></td>\n<td>原始叙述</td>\n<td>保留文本，不摘要，供人工复核</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>分类法对齐（taxonomy crosswalk）是这张表最关键也最容易偷懒的部分</strong>。CPSC 的危险面是 fire、burn、choking、entrapment、ingestion、electrocution、drowning、tip-over、strangulation 等受控词汇；欧盟 Safety Gate 有自己的风险类别体系；公司内部又有一套工单分类码。三者必须建一张显式映射表，而不是在代码里散落 <code>if</code> 判断；映射表还要能反向查询——「内部码 CHEM-LEAK 在监管侧对应哪一类」——因为下游既要按内部口径筛，也要按法域口径上报。注意 <code>severity_claim</code> 是<strong>来源声称的</strong>严重度而非判定结论：把「用户说很严重」和「监管认定严重风险」压进同一个字段，会让下游误以为研判已完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间与实体的归一-四类时间戳与实体消解\">时间与实体的归一：四类时间戳与实体消解</h2><p><strong>时间字段的归一化比字段名对齐更隐蔽。</strong> 以 openFDA 召回记录为例，它同时带 <code>event_date_initiated</code>（召回发起）、<code>event_date_created</code>（记录创建）、<code>event_date_posted</code>（记录发布）、<code>event_date_terminated</code>（事件终止）四个时间。只取一个 <code>date</code> 字段，就会丢掉「事件何时真正发生」与「监管何时公开」之间那段可能长达数月的间隔——而这段间隔正是评估响应时效的关键。因此统一模型至少保留 <code>occurred_at</code>（事件本身）与 <code>reported_at</code>（对外可见）两个语义时间。</p>\n<p>**实体消解（entity resolution）**解决「同一件事被多个源各报一遍」。一条充电宝鼓包：客服工单、评论、平台通知各产生一条信号，却指向同一台产品、同一批货、同一个危险。消解依据三类锚点的组合——产品标识（GTIN/型号，缺失时降级到 SKU）、危险分类、时间邻近度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>merge</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mtext>prod</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>prod</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mtext>hazard</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>hazard</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>W</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{merge}(s_i, s_j) = \\mathbb{1}\\!\\left[\\text{prod}(s_i)=\\text{prod}(s_j)\\right] \\cdot \\mathbb{1}\\!\\left[\\text{hazard}(s_i)=\\text{hazard}(s_j)\\right] \\cdot \\mathbb{1}\\!\\left[\\,|t_i - t_j| \\le W\\,\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">merge</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">prod</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">prod</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hazard</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hazard</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是合并时间窗（按品类可配置，快消品常取数天）。三个指示函数同时为真才合并，任何一维不匹配都保留为独立信号——<strong>把两条不同危险错误合并，比把同一危险拆成两条的代价高得多</strong>：合并后的信号簇会抬高严重度判定，进而触发本不该有的召回动作。消解结果是一个<strong>信号簇（signal cluster）</strong>，簇内保留全部成员信号及其溯源指针，簇本身携带聚合后的强度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信号质量治理-去重-强度加权与源可靠性\">信号质量治理：去重、强度加权与源可靠性</h2><p><strong>去重</strong>分两级：精确去重按幂等键处理重复采集；语义去重按上节的实体消解处理「同一事件多源陈述」。两级必须分开实现——把语义去重塞进采集层，会让重试变得不可预测。</p>\n<p><strong>强度加权</strong>的直觉是：权威源、结构化源、多源交叉印证的信号权重更高。可用一个可解释的线性组合建模：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>strength</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>authority</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>channel</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>recency</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{strength}(c) = \\sum_{s \\in c} w_{\\text{authority}}(s) \\cdot w_{\\text{channel}}(s) \\cdot w_{\\text{recency}}(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">strength</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3274em;vertical-align:-1.2774em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">authority</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">channel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recency</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>authority</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\text{authority}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">authority</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 按来源族取值（监管通报 &gt; 平台判定 &gt; 用户描述），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>channel</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\text{channel}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">channel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 按结构化程度取值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>recency</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\text{recency}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recency</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随时间衰减。这套权重要<strong>显式可配置且可版本化</strong>，因为它直接影响召回决策——监管审计时你必须能解释「为什么这条信号当时被判定为高强度」。<strong>源可靠性跟踪</strong>常被忽略：某些源会系统性误报（某类目的评论经常把误用写成缺陷），系统应记录每个源的历史准确率并回写权重，让研判结论反馈回信号层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>信号 ≠ 事故</strong>：信号是待研判原料，事故是已确认事实（GPSR 第 3 条定义），状态不能混在一个字段。</li>\n<li><strong>三族源、三种通道</strong>：运营内源走流式、监管公开源走拉取、渠道平台源走推送。</li>\n<li><strong>落地先于归一化</strong>：原始记录连同 <code>fetched_at</code>、源快照、<code>raw_hash</code> 先落原始区，归一化可重放。</li>\n<li><strong>统一字段 + 分类法对齐</strong>：<code>signal_type</code>、<code>hazard_code</code>、<code>product_ref</code> 是语义锚点，跨机构码表必须建显式 crosswalk。</li>\n<li><strong>两时间 + 实体消解</strong>：保留 <code>occurred_at</code> 与 <code>reported_at</code>；消解三锚点任一不匹配就不合并，宁可拆不可错并。</li>\n<li><strong>强度可解释</strong>：权威、通道、时效三维加权且可版本化，源可靠性随历史准确率回写；产品标识是跨源消解的基础设施。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>主要来源：欧盟 GPSR（Regulation (EU) 2023/988，第 3、20、24 条，EUR-Lex）；CPSC 召回库受控词汇（cpsc.gov/Recalls）；openFDA 器械召回可检索字段（open.fda.gov/apis/device/recall/searchable-fields/）；GS1 EPCIS 2.0 与 CBV 2.0（2022 年 6 月批准，GS1）。\n$$</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"安全信号来源分类、采集与归一化数据模型","id":"安全信号来源分类-采集与归一化数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：安全信号的定义边界与采集流水线位置","id":"核心概念-安全信号的定义边界与采集流水线位置"},{"level":2,"text":"信号源分类：运营内源、监管公开源与渠道平台源","id":"信号源分类-运营内源-监管公开源与渠道平台源"},{"level":2,"text":"多源采集通道：拉取、推送、流式的取舍","id":"多源采集通道-拉取-推送-流式的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"归一化数据模型：统一 signal 实体与分类法对齐","id":"归一化数据模型-统一-signal-实体与分类法对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"时间与实体的归一：四类时间戳与实体消解","id":"时间与实体的归一-四类时间戳与实体消解"},{"level":2,"text":"信号质量治理：去重、强度加权与源可靠性","id":"信号质量治理-去重-强度加权与源可靠性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分法域通报时限、报告义务与监管接口矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-product-recall-safety-response/recall-regime-liability-model/notification-timeline-regulator-interface-map"},"next":{"title":"危害风险评分、分级研判与召回触发管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-product-recall-safety-response/safety-signal-risk-data-system/hazard-risk-scoring-pipeline"}}